{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05785","headline":"嵩山十志十首 其一 · 卢鸿一","name":"嵩山十志十首 其一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山爲宅兮草爲堂，芝兰兮药房。\n罗蘼芜兮拍薜荔，荃壁兮兰砌。\n蘼芜薜荔兮成草堂，阴阴邃兮馥馥香。\n中有人兮信宜常，读金书兮饮玉浆，童颜幽操兮不易长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢鸿一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}